compartmentId, entitySource, computeId,
managementAgentId (+4 more); exact
compartmentId, entitySource, computeId,
managementAgentId, enterpriseManagerIdentifier,
enterpriseManagerBridgeId,
enterpriseManagerEntityIdentifier,
exadataInsightId match within the resource
